<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26we-ss-1-logic-deontic-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "MUST";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Obligation to comply with section 15 not to do an act that breaches Australian Privacy Principle 11.1.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies if: ... (i) an APP entity holds personal information relating to one or more individuals; and (ii) the APP entity is required under section 15 not to do an act, or engage in a practice, that breaches Australian Privacy Principle 11.1 in relation to the personal information;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) This section applies if: ... (i) an APP entity holds personal information relating to one or more individuals; and (ii) the APP entity is required under section 15 not to do an act, or engage in a practice, that breaches Australian Privacy Principle 11.1 in relation to the personal information;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 0.5000;
